<h1>Suppliers</h1>

<p>Meridian Castings works with a fixed panel of approved suppliers for raw materials, consumables and subcontract processes. This section covers our terms of supply and the process for joining the panel; it is not a general purchasing enquiry form.</p>

<p>Existing suppliers with a portal account can sign in to view open purchase orders, submit certificates of conformity and check payment status. If you do not yet have an account, contact your usual buyer or use our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

